<title>UK: C.Salvesen names Aggreko deputy chairman.</title>
<headline>C.Salvesen names Aggreko deputy chairman.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diversified distribution group Christian Salvesen Plc said on Monday it had appointed Philip Rogerson non-executive deputy chairman designate of its Aggreko equipment hire business.</p>
<p>Aggreko is set to be demerged by the end of September, the group said in a statement.</p>
<p>Rogerson is deputy chairman of BG Plc, and currently responsible for all major regulatory issues affecting the company.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
